<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Join us for the fourth CPVMA Pre-Veterinary Symposium, a hybrid event that will bring together leading experts and students from the field of veterinary medicine. Come learn about sustainability practices that will help this vital industry keep thriving now and for future generations. This is a unique opportunity to network, learn, and gain valuable insights from industry leaders. The symposium will take place on May 2-4, 2025. Don't miss your chance to be a part of this groundbreaking event. Register now to secure your spot and be a part of shaping the future of veterinary medicine!)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
